{
 "_note": "单件待办组件:按实例参数 id 从 `w.f` 取那一条。",
 "version": 1,
 "actions": [
  {
   "_note": "页面算好的整份视图(tools/todo/src/model.js buildW)。没写过 = {} → any/ok 都落 0,组件走空态。",
   "id": "w",
   "action": "data.get",
   "params": {
    "key": "w",
    "default": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "_note": "屏障:data.get 之后紧邻的一步读不到结果(晚一拍,df 章「屏障」)。",
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "_b",
    "value": "1"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "d",
    "value": "$[formatDate::(${@time.nowMs},yyyy-MM-dd)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "_note": "今天零点(设备时区)。与页面 JS 的 new Date(y,m,d) 同一个值 —— 行标签全靠它和 dm 比。",
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "tdm",
    "value": "$[parseDate::(${d},yyyy-MM-dd)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "base",
    "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${w.base},0)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "_note": "今天是页面保存那天之后第几天。parseNumber 0 = 截成整数串:index:: 要整数下标(Android 的 calc 返回 double)。",
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "off",
    "value": "$[parseNumber::(round::(calc::((${tdm}-${base})/86400000)),0)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "_note": "按天摊开的格只有 14 天;超出 = 页面太久没打开,随日子变的量不可信,组件显示「数据未更新」。",
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "ok",
    "value": "$[if::(and::(gt::(${base},0),ge::(${off},0),lt::(${off},14)),1,0)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "any",
    "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${w.any},0)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "_note": "入参先落地。",
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "fid",
    "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${id},)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "f",
    "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${fid}),0),get::(${w.f},${fid}),)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "_note": "取不到 = 这件已被删除,或完成超过 3 天(页面只给组件留最近 3 天完成的)。",
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "has",
    "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${f.id},__none__),__none__),0,1)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "picked",
    "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${fid}),0),1,0)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "sweep",
    "value": "$[if::(eq::(${has},1),round::(calc::(${f.pg}*3.6)),0)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "ic",
    "value": "${w.ic}"
   }
  },
  {
   "action": "resultFilter",
   "params": {
    "keys": [
     "f",
     "has",
     "picked",
     "tdm",
     "any",
     "sweep",
     "ic"
    ]
   }
  }
 ]
}